# W30b, host a (k10): after b's first trip (b sets its return mat to dng205b2) a hosts Dry Land, first only stag0201-0202
# and dng205b1; after b's first arrival by the return mat it walks on to dng205b2.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@360
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng205b1,control
wander 0 0 30 until epoch>=@600
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng205b2,control
log a in dng205b2
wander 0 0 30 until present=2,sealed>=600 or epoch>=@900
log b joined a in B2
